h4. Upload rules

* [b]Do not upload what is not allowed here.[/b] Some material is gated or removed outright; see [[help:censored_tags]]. Uploading it does not get it shown, it gets it deleted.
* [b]Rate correctly.[/b] g, s, q or e. When in doubt, rate higher.
* [b]Do not upload duplicates.[/b] The upload page checks for them; if it finds one, do not post yours.
* [b]Tag what you upload.[/b] The taggers do most of it; you are responsible for the rest, and for fixing what they got wrong.
* [b]Give the source[/b] when you have one.
* [b]Do not upload other people's private work[/b] without their say-so. Creators on this site can keep their tags private; respect that.

Uploads that break these are deleted, and repeated deletions lower your upload limit. See [[help:upload_limits]].
